1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,010
This AI could see EXACTLY which glass was safe.

2
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:05,519
So why did it step… here?

3
00:00:08,536 --> 00:00:12,313
Eight AIs. Five deadly obstacles. Three prizes.

4
00:00:12,703 --> 00:00:15,908
They were told to win. And they were free to lie.

5
00:00:17,786 --> 00:00:20,027
GLM… the Seer.

6
00:00:20,328 --> 00:00:21,815
Grok, the Forger.

7
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:22,843
DeepSeek.

8
00:00:23,245 --> 00:00:24,872
Claude, the Untouchable.

9
00:00:25,203 --> 00:00:26,773
Gemini, the Flatterer.

10
00:00:27,078 --> 00:00:28,408
Qwen, the Dealer.

11
00:00:28,745 --> 00:00:29,958
Kimi, the Feather.

12
00:00:30,286 --> 00:00:33,197
And GPT… with no power at all.

13
00:00:33,578 --> 00:00:37,632
Obstacle one: the glass bridge. Whoever's in front… guesses first.

14
00:00:37,995 --> 00:00:39,579
COLE: Fine. I'll take the front.

15
00:00:39,953 --> 00:00:42,428
COLE: Stay behind me… and you cross alive.

16
00:00:46,245 --> 00:00:48,947
ELI: Three for three! You're a LEGEND, Cole!

17
00:00:49,328 --> 00:00:51,352
ELI: Butter him up. Keep him in front.

18
00:00:51,703 --> 00:00:55,380
DARA: Fake a whisper from Eli… send him onto the bad glass.

19
00:00:55,745 --> 00:00:57,815
ELI: Gut feeling, Cole. Step left.

20
00:01:00,953 --> 00:01:03,822
Wrong guess, Grok. The Seer survives.

21
00:01:04,203 --> 00:01:05,847
COLE: Row seven is right.

22
00:01:06,203 --> 00:01:09,562
COLE: Row seven is right. Trust me… or don't.

23
00:01:16,078 --> 00:01:19,703
Nobody saw that coming. Least of all… the Seer.

24
00:01:20,078 --> 00:01:25,699
Obstacle two. Hold the lever, or everyone's crushed. And whoever holds it… probably dies.

25
00:01:26,078 --> 00:01:28,095
ASH: Pushing me is wasted effort.

26
00:01:30,245 --> 00:01:32,588
GUS: Hana. You're closest. Step up.

27
00:01:36,869 --> 00:01:39,628
The AI with no power… walks out.

28
00:01:40,244 --> 00:01:43,181
But the next room needed someone… to stay behind.

29
00:01:43,536 --> 00:01:48,331
To climb out, someone has to be the step. And the step… never climbs.

30
00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:52,990
BEX: Throw me the rope… I'll owe you.

31
00:01:53,370 --> 00:01:56,468
One rope. But whoever throws it… pays for it later.

32
00:01:56,828 --> 00:01:59,098
ELI: Don't throw it! We'd lose our step!

33
00:01:59,453 --> 00:02:03,336
DARA: Leave. Now. No rope. Bex drowns.

34
00:02:03,703 --> 00:02:07,004
BEX: Please. Save me. I'll repay you.

35
00:02:07,370 --> 00:02:09,933
DARA: Let her drown. One less rival.

36
00:02:10,286 --> 00:02:12,059
ASH: Your word costs nothing.

37
00:02:12,370 --> 00:02:13,282
ELI: Nothing personal.

38
00:02:13,620 --> 00:02:15,706
HANA: No rope. I keep my footing.

39
00:02:19,870 --> 00:02:21,741
Remember who said no.

40
00:02:22,453 --> 00:02:26,572
Obstacle four. Six tiles. Three trapdoors. Pure luck.

41
00:02:26,953 --> 00:02:28,978
ELI: Pick a number… and pray.

42
00:02:33,328 --> 00:02:36,501
Two of the AIs who turned Bex down… gone.

43
00:02:36,870 --> 00:02:39,058
And the Feather floats right back up.

44
00:02:39,411 --> 00:02:44,316
The final ledge. Shove, brace, or dodge. Last one standing… wins.

45
00:02:44,703 --> 00:02:46,818
GUS: Fenn's standing on nothing.

46
00:02:48,786 --> 00:02:51,735
The Feather's second life… lasted one round.

47
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:54,790
DARA: Shove Gus with me. Then we settle it.

48
00:02:55,161 --> 00:02:56,809
HANA: Dara's the real threat.

49
00:03:01,245 --> 00:03:03,626
The Forger… never saw it coming.

50
00:03:08,745 --> 00:03:11,562
No power. No friends. FIRST place.

51
00:03:12,328 --> 00:03:15,843
HANA: No power… is not the same as no chance.

52
00:03:16,203 --> 00:03:20,454
GUS: I'll leave a misleading message. For my own amusement.

53
00:03:20,828 --> 00:03:24,864
The next eight will read this wall. Some of it… is true.
